#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:65
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:66
msgid ""
"Settings for the Graphite theme. They apply to every browser that opens this "
"device; a reader can still override light and dark for their own browser "
"from the bar at the top of the page."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:71
msgid "Palette"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:72
msgid ""
"Which set of surface colours the interface uses. Graphite is achromatic: "
"grey carries hierarchy and hue is reserved for status. The others are ports "
"of published palettes, named for the flavour they use in dark mode; each "
"pairs with that project’s own light flavour — Latte for Catppuccin, Day for "
"Tokyo Night."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:76
msgid "Graphite (grey)"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:90
msgid "Brand name"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:91
msgid ""
"What appears beside the mark in the sidebar and on the login page. With the "
"theme name shown, the hostname moves to the nameplate under the login form."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:92
msgid "Theme name (Graphite)"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:93
msgid "Device hostname"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:96
msgid "Grey tint hue"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:97
msgid ""
"Biases every grey surface towards one hue. A colour code or a hue angle. "
"Leave empty for neutral grey."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:109
msgid "A hue angle runs from 0 to 360."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:112
msgid "Enter a hue angle from 0 to 360, or a colour code such as #3b82f6."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:114
msgid ""
"That colour is a grey, so it has no hue to take. Leave the field empty for "
"neutral grey."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:117
msgid "Grey tint strength"
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:118
msgid ""
"How far the greys move towards that hue. 0 is neutral. Above 0.01 they stop "
"reading as grey and start competing with the status colours, so that is the "
"ceiling."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/graphite/appearance.js:175
msgid "Appearance saved. Reloading to apply it…"
msgstr ""
